seg-a1c05079de2f = Each epoch after calibration gets a score from { "0" } to { "100" } and the reasons it is not { "100" }: which checks deducted, their statistic against threshold, and their points. Bands (edges stated in the session): <c1/> at { "90" } or above, <c2/> at { "55" } or above, <c3/> below. The mapping, every weight and its reason are in <a1><c4/></a1>; it is deterministic and fixed before a log is scored, with no learning and nothing fitted to events.

# text
