# c2: #
# c3: <desc>
# c4: session.result.json
# c5: session.trust.csv
# c6: score
# c7: score_reasons
# c8: session.trust.svg
seg-d56822e82e3d = Every vessel output carries the advisory statement: the <c1/> key of the result JSON and of each live line, a first <c2/> comment line of the CSV (readers skip it with their comment option), the <c3/> and a footer of the SVG. Outputs of a batch run: <c4/> (with the score model and every epoch's deductions), <c5/> (with <c6/> and <c7/> columns) and <c8/>, which for a vessel is the receiver-reported track coloured by trust band above the score over time.

