seg-92f452bdbed6 = <em>Track</em>, north up, one scale on both axes: the receiver-reported positions as a line coloured by the epoch's band (grey calibrating, green nominal, amber degraded, red untrusted), start and end marked, a scale bar. For the demo, the true track as a thin neutral line under it, so the drag-off shows as the two separating; a toggle for the true track and an offset-in-metres readout at the cursor's time.

