seg-869c8a92e2cf = <b>Interactions.</b> One time cursor shared by every panel (drag, arrow keys, and a play button that replays at 1x to 60x); hovering the track or any strip moves it. Clicking a deduction highlights the epochs in which that monitor was above its onset. A band filter (show only degraded and untrusted epochs) and a jump to the first deduction and to the first untrusted epoch. Hover text on every monitor name giving the one-line description from this page. The session's thresholds and weights are shown, read-only, beside the chart, so what the score used is on screen.

